WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.363
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.633 --> 00:30.051
TAKE CHARGE OF MY HEART

3
00:43.648 --> 00:45.233
We kissed.

4
01:10.758 --> 01:13.303
My very first kiss…

5
01:18.349 --> 01:20.685
wasn't anything like the ones in books or dramas.

6
01:20.768 --> 01:23.521
No bells. No sparks.

7
01:24.022 --> 01:25.148
But…

8
01:56.971 --> 01:58.223
the time…

9
01:59.057 --> 02:00.808
flew by so ****ing fast.

10
02:01.309 --> 02:02.977
It's morning already.

11
02:36.219 --> 02:37.095
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

12
02:40.223 --> 02:41.599
Come out.

13
02:42.225 --> 02:43.059
I can see you.

14
02:47.397 --> 02:48.231
Oh.

15
02:49.482 --> 02:50.316
You're here.

16
02:52.819 --> 02:53.653
Why'd you hide?

17
02:54.404 --> 02:56.030
No, I wasn't hiding.

18
02:56.114 --> 02:58.908
The table looked a bit wobbly,

19
02:58.992 --> 03:00.702
so I was just checking.

20
03:00.785 --> 03:02.412
It's fine now.

21
03:06.582 --> 03:07.417
Ms. Na.

22
03:08.209 --> 03:09.127
Yes?

23
03:12.880 --> 03:13.965
I…

24
03:15.174 --> 03:18.094
Is he about to ask me out now that we've kissed?

25
03:18.678 --> 03:19.721
Or

26
03:20.680 --> 03:22.265
does he want another kiss?

27
03:26.519 --> 03:27.562
It's a kiss.

28
03:27.645 --> 03:29.772
…need

29
03:30.356 --> 03:31.524
a charge.

30
03:33.776 --> 03:34.610
What?

31
03:35.737 --> 03:37.697
A charge.

32
03:38.990 --> 03:39.991
Oh.

33
03:42.035 --> 03:44.829
Right, a charge.

34
03:44.912 --> 03:46.789
A charge.

35
03:47.582 --> 03:49.375
What were you imagining?

36
03:49.459 --> 03:51.878
What? Imagine what?

37
03:51.961 --> 03:53.921
Let's go. I'll charge you.

38
04:09.729 --> 04:13.066
What? Where are you going? You said you needed a charge.

39
04:16.652 --> 04:18.237
Let's do it here.

40
04:21.657 --> 04:22.533
In your room.

41
04:30.208 --> 04:31.042
This is

42
04:32.543 --> 04:34.087
my room?

43
04:35.755 --> 04:37.757
Don't say no this time.

44
04:51.187 --> 04:54.399
You should stay in the house. Stop living in the garage.

45
05:07.120 --> 05:08.079
What are you doing?

46
05:09.205 --> 05:11.332
I'm just grateful for everything.

47
05:15.044 --> 05:17.213
Consider it a bonus charge.

48
05:22.552 --> 05:24.595
You were supposed to charge me anyway.

49
05:29.767 --> 05:31.894
Seriously? You always do whatever you want.

50
05:34.689 --> 05:37.108
All right, we're done.

51
05:37.608 --> 05:38.651
That's enough!

52
05:50.663 --> 05:54.500
We should apologize to Ms. Na, right?

53
05:55.793 --> 05:58.754
Should I talk to her first?

54
05:58.838 --> 05:59.672
Yeah.

55
06:04.594 --> 06:05.428
Ms. Na.

56
06:06.596 --> 06:08.014
-Yes? -Well…

57
06:08.097 --> 06:10.683
It's almost lunchtime.

58
06:10.766 --> 06:13.269
If you don't have lunch plans with Mr. Baek,

59
06:13.352 --> 06:15.688
would you like to join us?

60
06:16.814 --> 06:18.065
Sure.

61
06:18.149 --> 06:19.025
Wait.

62
06:19.108 --> 06:21.068
You always have lunch with Mr. Baek.

63
06:21.152 --> 06:22.737
Are you sure that's okay?

64
06:22.820 --> 06:24.655
Yes, it's totally fine.

65
06:25.239 --> 06:27.867
Great! Let's go have something nice.

66
06:27.950 --> 06:29.035
Sounds good.

67
06:33.623 --> 06:35.166
Who said you could do that?

68
06:46.135 --> 06:47.345
Wow.

69
06:47.428 --> 06:51.098
It's been a long time since we had lunch together, sir.

70
06:51.182 --> 06:53.142
We just had a team dinner in Jeju.

71
06:53.768 --> 06:55.394
Yes. You're right.

72
06:55.478 --> 06:57.313
We did. Silly me.

73
06:58.356 --> 06:59.565
Lunch with Ms. Na

74
07:00.691 --> 07:03.110
was part of my routine.

75
07:03.194 --> 07:05.530
But she agreed to have lunch with you so readily.

76
07:06.405 --> 07:07.240
That surprised me.

77
07:08.324 --> 07:09.700
Sir.

78
07:09.784 --> 07:12.578
We felt like we owed her an apology,

79
07:12.662 --> 07:14.413
so we asked her to lunch.

80
07:16.707 --> 07:18.417
Well, you see…

81
07:18.501 --> 07:21.128
When the rumors about you and Mr. Ji started spreading,

82
07:21.212 --> 07:24.298
I believed them and treated you coldly. I'm sorry.

83
07:24.799 --> 07:25.925
I'm really sorry.

84
07:26.008 --> 07:29.554
I mean, they even figured out you were a drama writer, so--

85
07:30.680 --> 07:31.847
I'm really sorry.

86
07:32.431 --> 07:33.474
I'm sorry.

87
07:33.558 --> 07:35.059
No, don't be.

88
07:35.142 --> 07:39.397
It's hard to know what to believe with rumors like that. I understand.

89
07:39.480 --> 07:42.024
How could you judge someone like that?

90
07:42.984 --> 07:44.569
Reflect on your actions.

91
07:47.029 --> 07:49.574
It's really okay. Please enjoy your meal.

92
07:53.160 --> 07:54.662
Ms. Na.

93
07:55.830 --> 07:59.625
Do you really have no feelings for Mr. Ji Eun-ho?

94
08:06.340 --> 08:07.341
Well…

95
08:08.634 --> 08:09.802
Yes.

96
08:10.303 --> 08:14.390
Eun-ho's just a close friend. He's like a little brother to me.

97
08:14.473 --> 08:15.433
That's all.

98
08:16.475 --> 08:17.935
I mean, he's handsome,

99
08:18.561 --> 08:19.937
younger than you,

100
08:20.771 --> 08:24.567
and a huge star who would do anything for you.

101
08:24.650 --> 08:26.777
If you're not interested in him,

102
08:27.486 --> 08:30.781
I'm curious to know what your ideal type is like.

103
08:31.282 --> 08:32.283
Wow.

104
08:32.867 --> 08:35.578
I've never heard Mr. Yoon ask a question like that.

105
08:35.661 --> 08:36.495
Huh?

106
08:37.413 --> 08:39.874
Could it be that he has a crush on Ms. Na?

107
08:45.504 --> 08:47.214
I'm just curious.

108
08:47.882 --> 08:49.717
No ulterior motives.

109
08:52.178 --> 08:53.512
My ideal type…

110
08:56.098 --> 08:58.434
If I say anything that sounds like Mr. Baek,

111
08:58.517 --> 08:59.810
they'll figure me out.

112
09:02.480 --> 09:05.358
Well, for starters, I…

113
09:09.320 --> 09:11.489
-I like free spirits. -"Free"?

114
09:11.572 --> 09:14.075
You know, someone who's a big P on the MBTI.

115
09:14.158 --> 09:18.204
Someone who makes impulsive decisions and just takes off on trips.

116
09:18.287 --> 09:19.288
"Impulsive"?

117
09:19.372 --> 09:22.041
Someone a bit younger than me

118
09:22.625 --> 09:25.336
with a fair, baby face.

119
09:25.419 --> 09:28.005
Chubby cheeks that stretch when you pinch them.

120
09:28.089 --> 09:29.423
Right. A face like tofu.

121
09:29.507 --> 09:30.591
Tofu face.

122
09:30.675 --> 09:31.550
"Tofu"?

123
09:31.634 --> 09:33.302
And I like someone

124
09:33.386 --> 09:36.972
with no muscles at all.

125
09:37.556 --> 09:40.059
I like them skinny. Like a twig.

126
09:41.018 --> 09:43.020
So that's why Mr. Ji didn't make the cut.

127
09:43.104 --> 09:45.272
Exactly. Eun-ho has muscles.

128
09:46.399 --> 09:47.858
You seem quite particular

129
09:49.151 --> 09:50.778
about your ideal man.

130
09:50.861 --> 09:54.073
Yeah, I have high standards.

131
10:08.254 --> 10:09.255
What are you doing?

132
10:09.839 --> 10:13.008
Should I lose some weight and muscle?

133
10:13.092 --> 10:13.926
Sorry?

134
10:14.009 --> 10:16.053
Do I have too much muscle?

135
10:17.263 --> 10:19.640
Wait, but I need chubbier cheeks.

136
10:20.266 --> 10:21.976
-How am I supposed to-- -Sir.

137
10:23.936 --> 10:26.397
-What? -The TS succession is imminent.

138
10:26.480 --> 10:27.440
You need to focus.

139
10:30.317 --> 10:32.737
Who says I'm not focused?

140
10:39.702 --> 10:42.371
Did you give them the slush fund ledger?

141
10:42.455 --> 10:46.167
Yes. Doseong Daily will handle the rest.

142
10:46.876 --> 10:50.129
They should've hidden their weaknesses before attacking me.

143
10:51.714 --> 10:55.217
They've got so many enemies. How dare they challenge me?

144
10:55.926 --> 10:56.761
Mr. Yoon.

145
10:57.928 --> 10:58.971
Sir?

146
10:59.555 --> 11:02.099
What's "a big P" in MBTI?

147
11:02.183 --> 11:03.017
Sorry?

148
11:03.100 --> 11:05.311
Ms. Na mentioned it earlier.

149
11:05.394 --> 11:10.483
She said she likes people with a big P in MBTI.

150
11:10.566 --> 11:11.400
Sir.

151
11:11.901 --> 11:13.611
I have to get back to work.

152
11:13.694 --> 11:15.946
I must attend to a very important matter

153
11:16.030 --> 11:18.365
to get ready for the succession of TS Group.

154
11:38.010 --> 11:42.431
A BIG P IN MBTI

155
11:57.404 --> 12:01.992
BACK VIEW OF I-HYEOK STANDING IN THE MEETING ROOM

156
12:07.206 --> 12:08.082
What is it?

157
12:08.165 --> 12:09.166
(NERVOUSLY)

158
12:10.292 --> 12:11.377
(PULLING HYE-JU TOWARDS HIM)

159
12:11.460 --> 12:12.378
Just a moment.

160
12:15.297 --> 12:18.300
What is it? Is there someone suspicious?

161
12:18.384 --> 12:20.094
-Am I in danger? -No.

162
12:20.177 --> 12:21.011
(GAZING TENDERLY)

163
12:21.095 --> 12:24.306
Even if you were, I would never let anyone hurt you.

164
12:25.724 --> 12:27.059
Why did you ask me to come here?

165
12:27.893 --> 12:28.769
No reason.

166
12:28.853 --> 12:29.687
(GAZING INTENSELY)

167
12:29.770 --> 12:31.480
(FLUSTERED)

168
12:32.356 --> 12:34.859
I-HYEOK PUSHES HYE-JU AGAINST THE WALL

169
12:34.942 --> 12:37.319
HYE-JU'S HEART RACES, READY TO BURST

170
12:38.404 --> 12:39.405
I just

171
12:40.155 --> 12:41.740
wanted to see you.

172
12:42.575 --> 12:43.534
Is that not okay?

173
12:43.617 --> 12:44.910
(SEDUCTIVELY)

174
12:46.620 --> 12:50.583
I-HYEOK LEANS IN TOWARD HYE-JU'S LIPS

175
12:50.666 --> 12:52.251
HYE-JU SURRENDERS TO HIM

176
12:52.334 --> 12:53.210
Ms. Na!

177
12:53.294 --> 12:54.461
Ms. Na!

178
12:55.170 --> 12:56.005
Yes?

179
13:03.262 --> 13:05.890
A moment of your time, please.

180
13:23.532 --> 13:24.366
What is it?

181
13:25.534 --> 13:26.744
Just a moment.

182
13:27.369 --> 13:31.373
Isn't this exactly what I just wrote in my script?

183
13:40.341 --> 13:43.385
What are you doing all of a sudden?

184
13:44.136 --> 13:45.137
I

185
13:45.721 --> 13:46.722
looked it up.

186
13:48.557 --> 13:49.391
Looked what up?

187
13:53.187 --> 13:55.564
A big P in MBTI.

188
13:56.523 --> 13:58.734
In the Myers–Briggs Type Indicator,

189
13:58.817 --> 14:00.611
P stands for perceiving.

190
14:00.694 --> 14:04.406
It refers to people with a strong tendency to perceive.

191
14:04.490 --> 14:06.283
Oh.

192
14:06.784 --> 14:07.826
Yes.

193
14:10.746 --> 14:14.375
P types tend to be free-spirited, flexible, exploratory,

194
14:14.875 --> 14:16.752
and spontaneous.

195
14:17.711 --> 14:19.421
Are you giving a presentation?

196
14:20.923 --> 14:24.635
-Why are you standing like-- -I asked for you on a whim.

197
14:24.718 --> 14:26.428
Openly hitting on you at work.

198
14:26.512 --> 14:28.430
It's not easy

199
14:28.514 --> 14:31.767
for a senior managing director at a major corporation

200
14:33.394 --> 14:34.770
to be this flexible.

201
14:34.853 --> 14:36.438
I don't think

202
14:36.939 --> 14:38.482
this is really a P thing.

203
14:38.565 --> 14:39.608
Really?

204
14:42.528 --> 14:43.612
How about this?

205
14:43.696 --> 14:44.780
What?

206
14:54.498 --> 14:57.126
Will you go out with me?

207
14:59.169 --> 15:00.004
What?

208
15:00.087 --> 15:01.714
I haven't asked you out yet.

209
15:03.173 --> 15:05.175
Let's date.

210
15:05.801 --> 15:07.970
Even after our contract ends,

211
15:09.221 --> 15:10.264
let's stay together.

212
15:17.896 --> 15:21.275
Didn't expect that, did you? Spontaneous and free-spirited, right?

213
15:22.276 --> 15:23.861
No, it's not that.

214
15:24.445 --> 15:25.404
I just…

215
15:28.699 --> 15:32.161
Since we already kissed,

216
15:32.911 --> 15:34.580
I thought we were dating.

217
15:34.663 --> 15:35.748
What?

218
15:37.708 --> 15:38.542
Oh.

219
15:40.002 --> 15:43.047
No, you're right. You're absolutely right.

220
15:43.756 --> 15:44.757
No, it's just…

221
15:44.840 --> 15:50.471
Earlier, you said your ideal type was a free-spirited, spontaneous P-type.

222
15:50.971 --> 15:51.805
Right?

223
15:53.140 --> 15:54.558
Ms. Na Bo-bae?

224
15:55.934 --> 15:57.728
What is it?

225
15:58.729 --> 15:59.980
Why are you laughing?

226
16:01.065 --> 16:02.649
Oh, Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

227
16:02.733 --> 16:04.234
How are you this cute?

228
16:05.694 --> 16:08.197
Cute? What do you mean?

229
16:08.781 --> 16:10.491
Don't you mean "cool"?

230
16:10.574 --> 16:12.534
No, you're really cute.

231
16:12.618 --> 16:15.162
Cute? I'm a grown man.

232
16:15.871 --> 16:17.873
Aw, is Ho-rang angry like a tiger?

233
16:17.956 --> 16:19.208
Poor baby.

234
16:19.792 --> 16:20.834
Rawr.

235
16:23.504 --> 16:26.423
Ms. Na Bo-bae. I take back what I said earlier.

236
16:29.218 --> 16:30.385
Mr. Baek…

237
16:30.469 --> 16:31.929
Mr. Baek Ho-rang, wait.

238
16:40.229 --> 16:42.439
Gosh, Baek Ho-rang is so cute.

239
16:42.523 --> 16:43.565
Seriously.

240
16:46.819 --> 16:48.153
"So cute"?

241
16:48.654 --> 16:50.656
Wow, that's so cringe.

242
16:51.657 --> 16:55.369
Then again, he was the one who started acting all cute.

243
16:56.537 --> 17:00.415
I mean, how can a grown man be so cute?

244
17:02.042 --> 17:03.544
Seriously.

245
17:07.965 --> 17:09.716
Will you go out with me?

246
17:21.478 --> 17:22.437
Huh?

247
17:24.940 --> 17:27.276
No. Stop that.

248
17:29.319 --> 17:30.612
Darn it.

249
17:30.696 --> 17:31.530
Ms. Na.

250
17:32.781 --> 17:35.450
I can feel it. This is going to be a hit.

251
17:36.034 --> 17:37.536
You've got yourself a contract!

252
17:37.619 --> 17:40.164
Oh my gosh! Director!

253
17:40.247 --> 17:41.081
Ms. Na!

254
17:41.165 --> 17:43.417
For real? My gosh!

255
17:46.044 --> 17:47.921
I knew you could do it.

256
17:51.049 --> 17:52.509
Look at you.

257
17:56.597 --> 17:57.472
Do I smell?

258
18:00.934 --> 18:02.477
Let's really lock in.

259
18:02.561 --> 18:04.438
I'll give this project my all.

260
18:19.453 --> 18:21.246
Man, this is…

261
18:22.581 --> 18:24.750
This is why experience matters.

262
18:24.833 --> 18:27.753
Just write it down as is, and it's a drama.

263
19:34.528 --> 19:35.445
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

264
19:36.280 --> 19:38.365
You should have breakfast.

265
19:39.199 --> 19:40.325
Okay?

266
19:44.788 --> 19:46.039
Come on. Wake up.

267
19:46.123 --> 19:48.542
Open up.

268
19:58.677 --> 20:00.470
Okay, that's it.

269
20:00.554 --> 20:03.098
You're fired as of today.

270
20:04.141 --> 20:04.975
What?

271
20:07.102 --> 20:07.978
Why…

272
20:09.146 --> 20:11.356
You're firing me?

273
20:12.274 --> 20:14.067
Your drama's at a crucial stage, right?

274
20:14.151 --> 20:16.320
You think about it day and night.

275
20:16.403 --> 20:18.322
Well, yeah, it's a crucial time.

276
20:18.405 --> 20:20.866
But did you really have to fire me?

277
20:20.949 --> 20:22.951
This is making me uncomfortable.

278
20:23.035 --> 20:26.246
I only hired you as my secretary to fool Choi Do-yoon.

279
20:26.830 --> 20:29.958
You've worked for over two months. That should be enough.

280
20:30.584 --> 20:33.211
Still, this is all so sudden.

281
20:33.712 --> 20:38.300
The whole point of our arrangement was so you could write your script.

282
20:38.383 --> 20:39.968
That has to come first.

283
20:42.471 --> 20:46.725
I'll have Mr. Yoon explain things to the other secretaries.

284
20:46.808 --> 20:49.519
Don't worry. Just focus on your script.

285
20:50.103 --> 20:51.772
Thanks for being so considerate.

286
20:55.400 --> 20:57.152
Ms. Writer Na Bo-bae.

287
20:57.819 --> 21:00.405
I'm off to work. See you later.

288
21:00.489 --> 21:03.325
Take your time and finish this.

289
21:19.966 --> 21:22.094
What was that? Honestly.

290
21:29.226 --> 21:31.520
Firing her was the right decision.

291
21:31.603 --> 21:34.689
It's too risky to keep Ms. Na around.

292
21:35.982 --> 21:36.942
What risk?

293
21:37.025 --> 21:39.152
Once the contract ends, you'll part ways.

294
21:39.236 --> 21:44.491
This is a perfectly natural way to gradually cut ties with her.

295
21:44.574 --> 21:47.035
What are you talking about? Why would I do that?

296
21:47.119 --> 21:49.663
I'm going to keep seeing her after our contract ends.

297
21:49.746 --> 21:51.206
Are you really dating her?

298
21:51.790 --> 21:53.500
Watch the road or we'll crash!

299
21:53.583 --> 21:54.543
Yes, sir.

300
22:00.882 --> 22:01.800
That's right.

301
22:01.883 --> 22:04.511
I'm dating Ms. Na Bo-bae.

302
22:09.224 --> 22:11.351
Mr. Yoon, have you lost your mind?

303
22:11.435 --> 22:12.352
I'm sorry.

304
22:12.436 --> 22:14.104
I thought I saw something ahead.

305
22:15.021 --> 22:16.356
Be careful.

306
22:17.023 --> 22:18.358
My heart can't take it.

307
22:20.318 --> 22:21.445
I'm sorry.

308
22:37.043 --> 22:38.128
Hey!

309
22:42.257 --> 22:44.301
Does that have caffeine in it?

310
22:44.384 --> 22:45.844
It's decaf.

311
22:45.927 --> 22:48.680
Don't lie to me. I felt the caffeine on my tongue!

312
22:49.431 --> 22:51.266
Don't you know I have trouble sleeping?

313
22:51.349 --> 22:53.894
Decaf, please!

314
22:53.977 --> 22:55.729
Yes, ma'am. I'm sorry.

315
22:56.229 --> 22:57.230
Unbelievable.

316
23:02.944 --> 23:04.988
Hi, Mom. What's up?

317
23:07.032 --> 23:08.033
A ledger?

318
23:10.035 --> 23:12.871
What? Do…

319
23:13.371 --> 23:15.332
Doseong Daily?

320
23:17.375 --> 23:18.919
Do you admit to the charges?

321
23:39.523 --> 23:42.526
Breaking news. Through Doseong Daily, JBS has obtained

322
23:42.609 --> 23:46.363
the TS Hotel slush fund ledger mentioned by Senior Managing Director Baek Ho-rang

323
23:46.446 --> 23:49.115
at TS Resort's emergency press conference.

324
23:49.199 --> 23:51.368
Assemblyman Choi Tae-sik was found to have fabricated

325
23:51.451 --> 23:53.870
the allegation that Mr. Baek mistreated people.

326
23:53.954 --> 23:57.624
Meanwhile, the dispute over the TS Group succession continues.

327
23:57.707 --> 23:59.501
We'll keep you updated as more…

328
23:59.584 --> 24:00.460
Baek Ho-rang.

329
24:01.461 --> 24:04.130
So this was your trump card?

330
24:04.631 --> 24:05.966
Baek Ho-rang!

331
24:08.927 --> 24:09.761
Sir.

332
24:09.844 --> 24:11.304
Move. You son of a bitch!

333
24:18.395 --> 24:19.354
Mr. Choi.

334
24:21.815 --> 24:23.066
Call security.

335
24:23.775 --> 24:24.609
They're coming.

336
24:25.193 --> 24:27.946
Why'd you only get my dad arrested?

337
24:28.029 --> 24:29.948
Why leave my mom and me out of it?

338
24:30.031 --> 24:32.909
Are you trying to humiliate me?

339
24:34.953 --> 24:36.746
Let go.

340
24:37.664 --> 24:38.957
Okay.

341
24:44.921 --> 24:46.464
You can't be that dumb.

342
24:47.424 --> 24:50.927
We have to get through TS's 30th anniversary party scandal-free.

343
24:51.011 --> 24:52.721
Just hang tight.

344
24:52.804 --> 24:56.308
I'll take care of the two of you once it's over.

345
24:56.391 --> 24:57.892
Take care of us?

346
25:07.402 --> 25:08.987
This is

347
25:10.030 --> 25:11.239
all you can do.

348
25:11.740 --> 25:14.492
Cursing, spitting, making a scene.

349
25:14.576 --> 25:16.286
That's just your level.

350
25:17.162 --> 25:21.333
Did you really think you and your family could get your hands on TS?

351
25:21.416 --> 25:22.250
Yeah.

352
25:23.501 --> 25:25.670
At least my family isn't dead.

353
25:26.588 --> 25:30.258
We're alive, so we can at least put up a fight.

354
25:30.759 --> 25:31.801
Instead of coming to me,

355
25:32.844 --> 25:35.096
go whine to your family

356
25:35.680 --> 25:36.931
while they're still alive.

357
25:37.849 --> 25:41.061
And you should take good care of Na Bo-bae.

358
25:41.686 --> 25:45.148
Everyone you care about ends up dead, don't they?

359
25:45.649 --> 25:48.026
Who knows? Na Bo-bae might also--

360
25:54.908 --> 25:56.868
Don't you dare

361
25:58.370 --> 26:00.413
drag Ms. Na into this.

362
26:00.497 --> 26:02.832
Sir, that's enough.

363
26:07.754 --> 26:09.631
-Clean this mess up. -Yes, sir.

364
26:10.965 --> 26:15.303
I have to go see my grandmother.

365
26:19.683 --> 26:22.185
How did you like the show I put on?

366
26:22.769 --> 26:24.688
The real embezzler has been exposed,

367
26:24.771 --> 26:26.648
the stock price is recovering,

368
26:27.232 --> 26:33.113
and thanks to the Ji Eun-ho incident, public opinion of TS Resort has improved.

369
26:33.196 --> 26:35.156
Patting yourself on the back, huh?

370
26:36.700 --> 26:37.742
Aren't you happy?

371
26:38.451 --> 26:40.370
I even took care of Uncle,

372
26:40.453 --> 26:42.997
who was a thorn in your side.

373
26:47.544 --> 26:50.505
At the upcoming 30th anniversary party,

374
26:51.715 --> 26:57.137
earn everyone's respect with those abilities you keep bragging about.

375
27:03.810 --> 27:04.811
Very well.

376
27:06.438 --> 27:07.689
See you at the party.

377
27:27.792 --> 27:28.877
You're here.

378
27:30.503 --> 27:32.255
I'm home.

379
27:33.006 --> 27:33.882
Come with me.

380
27:33.965 --> 27:35.550
Huh? What is it?

381
27:37.135 --> 27:38.178
What is it?

382
27:40.138 --> 27:42.223
"We're at the office. Are you crazy?"

383
27:45.310 --> 27:47.687
-Do I have to? -Come on. Just do it.

384
27:57.363 --> 27:58.865
"I don't care

385
27:59.449 --> 28:02.368
if we're at the office or on the street."

386
28:03.203 --> 28:05.872
"All I see is you, ma'am."

387
28:11.419 --> 28:12.587
Are you kidding me?

388
28:15.715 --> 28:17.008
That's not in the script.

389
28:17.091 --> 28:19.469
No, I'm asking if you're messing with me.

390
28:20.094 --> 28:21.971
You can't read the lines like that.

391
28:22.055 --> 28:24.974
You need to put some feeling into it and make it sound real.

392
28:25.475 --> 28:27.018
You're not helping at all.

393
28:27.101 --> 28:28.311
Am I an actor?

394
28:28.394 --> 28:30.313
I'm just a senior managing director.

395
28:30.396 --> 28:33.983
I just have to read the lines. Do I have to put emotion into it too?

396
28:34.067 --> 28:37.487
Eun-ho was always great at this. I wish I could call him.

397
28:37.570 --> 28:38.780
What?

398
28:38.863 --> 28:40.698
Why'd you have to bring him up?

399
28:40.782 --> 28:42.450
He's an actor, and I'm--

400
28:43.201 --> 28:45.453
Yes, Senior Managing Director of TS Resort.

401
28:45.537 --> 28:46.579
Please continue.

402
28:50.542 --> 28:51.459
I'm not doing it.

403
28:51.543 --> 28:52.710
Come on. Why?

404
28:52.794 --> 28:54.504
Don't be like that.

405
28:54.587 --> 28:57.131
Just read it once. Hurry.

406
28:57.215 --> 28:59.759
The other day at work, you were like,

407
29:00.969 --> 29:02.220
"Will you go out with me?"

408
29:02.303 --> 29:04.389
I told you to forget about that.

409
29:06.391 --> 29:09.394
I know you can do a good job. That's why I'm pushing you.

410
29:09.477 --> 29:10.937
Just try it one more time.

411
29:12.105 --> 29:13.273
"I don't care

412
29:13.773 --> 29:16.401
if we're at the office or on the street."

413
29:16.484 --> 29:20.280
"All I see is you, ma'am!"

414
29:23.575 --> 29:24.951
Mom.

415
29:25.451 --> 29:26.911
Mom, it's a misunderstanding.

416
29:26.995 --> 29:30.623
You know he's a man of integrity.

417
29:30.707 --> 29:33.960
He's a four-term assemblyman and a presidential front-runner.

418
29:34.043 --> 29:35.169
Do you think…

419
29:37.255 --> 29:39.674
I'll go easy on you because you're my daughter?

420
29:40.842 --> 29:43.303
This isn't the time to be defending your husband.

421
29:47.515 --> 29:48.850
Why can't you go easy on me?

422
29:49.976 --> 29:52.061
How can you treat me worse than a dog?

423
29:52.145 --> 29:53.897
You trust your dead son more than me?

424
29:53.980 --> 29:56.649
Do you care more about Lucky Charm, that damn dog, than me?

425
29:57.233 --> 29:58.151
Of course.

426
30:00.820 --> 30:01.654
What did you say?

427
30:02.238 --> 30:06.117
If Gyeong-seok were still alive, I would have retired a long time ago.

428
30:06.200 --> 30:09.579
He was sharp at his job and had the guts to think big.

429
30:11.039 --> 30:13.416
Obviously, you're no match for Gyeong-seok.

430
30:14.834 --> 30:18.129
You know, I expected more from you because you're my daughter.

431
30:19.589 --> 30:22.258
But Gyeong-seok was the one who took after me,

432
30:22.759 --> 30:23.593
not you.

433
30:25.261 --> 30:27.639
Do I care more about my dog than you?

434
30:28.514 --> 30:32.727
He does exactly what I say. He even plays dead when I tell him to.

435
30:33.561 --> 30:35.939
He's cute and does adorable things.

436
30:36.439 --> 30:37.357
But you…

437
30:39.067 --> 30:42.362
You flounder through life, consumed by your insecurities.

438
30:42.445 --> 30:43.404
It's pathetic.

439
30:44.155 --> 30:47.575
You're foolish, can't do anything right,

440
30:47.659 --> 30:50.620
and you married a man just like you.

441
30:51.829 --> 30:52.789
Do I…

442
30:54.248 --> 30:57.377
Do I have to be good at everything? Do I have to be perfect?

443
30:57.460 --> 30:58.628
I'm your daughter!

444
31:00.630 --> 31:03.091
Please, Mom! Please!

445
31:03.174 --> 31:08.888
Can you stop treating me as a racehorse and see me as your daughter for once?

446
31:10.306 --> 31:13.184
Do you even know why I've been insecure my whole life?

447
31:13.267 --> 31:16.604
It's all because of you! This is how I was raised!

448
31:17.814 --> 31:19.190
Gyeong-jin.

449
31:20.733 --> 31:23.861
You resent me, don't you? Maybe even hate me.

450
31:26.114 --> 31:29.367
You must wonder how it's possible for a mother to be like this.

451
31:31.369 --> 31:32.578
But…

452
31:36.124 --> 31:37.041
I feel the same way.

453
31:39.502 --> 31:41.671
I resent you too.

454
31:41.754 --> 31:43.423
I hate the sight of you.

455
31:45.216 --> 31:48.594
Why is the only child I have left so disappointing?

456
31:48.678 --> 31:51.556
I miss Gyeong-seok so much it hurts.

457
31:56.811 --> 31:58.104
You're unbelievable.

458
32:04.485 --> 32:06.154
What was I expecting?

459
32:08.531 --> 32:09.949
From Chairwoman Gong Man-seol.

460
32:11.284 --> 32:14.370
You, Choi Tae-sik, and Do-yoon…

461
32:14.912 --> 32:17.415
Get ready to return everything you've received.

462
32:48.321 --> 32:49.572
Mr. Baek Ho-rang!

463
32:50.281 --> 32:51.532
Yes? What is it?

464
32:51.616 --> 32:53.034
-Look at this. -Huh?

465
32:53.117 --> 32:54.327
CHOI TAE-SIK ARRESTED

466
32:54.410 --> 32:57.330
-Your name is cleared, right? -It was all over the news yesterday.

467
32:57.413 --> 33:00.583
-You didn't know? -I was busy writing my script.

468
33:00.666 --> 33:03.002
Why didn't you tell me? This is great news!

469
33:03.086 --> 33:04.462
You knew this would happen.

470
33:04.545 --> 33:05.671
Yeah, but still…

471
33:06.422 --> 33:08.966
Sit down. Charge me.

472
33:14.764 --> 33:15.598
Huh?

473
33:15.681 --> 33:16.933
You're fully charged.

474
33:18.684 --> 33:23.397
We still have to do the morning charge. It's in the contract.

475
33:23.481 --> 33:26.067
What? There's no such thing.

476
33:27.068 --> 33:28.569
You don't want to hold hands?

477
33:29.070 --> 33:31.197
No, it's not that I don't want to.

478
33:31.823 --> 33:35.993
You could just ask me to hold your hand instead of using charging as an excuse.

479
33:40.957 --> 33:41.791
Then…

480
33:44.168 --> 33:45.419
let's keep holding hands.

481
33:50.091 --> 33:51.217
Okay.

482
34:53.905 --> 34:55.990
-What? -Nothing.

483
35:01.537 --> 35:03.539
Why are you trying to pull your hand away?

484
35:04.040 --> 35:05.166
Someone's walking by.

485
35:05.249 --> 35:08.794
Wow, it's obvious you've never been in a relationship.

486
35:09.420 --> 35:12.298
Is holding hands really that embarrassing?

487
35:12.381 --> 35:15.259
Not really, but it's kind of… you know.

488
35:15.843 --> 35:18.679
So what, you've been in lots of relationships?

489
35:18.763 --> 35:21.474
A few girls flirted with you. That's about it.

490
35:21.974 --> 35:24.936
It's not like you have a lot of dating experience either.

491
35:25.019 --> 35:27.188
Maybe not, but definitely more than you.

492
35:33.236 --> 35:34.195
Oh, how many?

493
35:34.278 --> 35:35.529
What?

494
35:37.031 --> 35:38.074
Oh.

495
35:39.533 --> 35:40.451
Not that many.

496
35:41.494 --> 35:42.411
Not many at all.

497
35:43.162 --> 35:44.872
You're my first, Ms. Na Bo-bae.

498
35:45.456 --> 35:46.540
Watch what you say.

499
35:47.416 --> 35:48.251
I will.

500
35:58.844 --> 36:00.888
I've never done this with anyone before.

501
36:00.972 --> 36:02.348
Kissing on the street.

502
36:06.269 --> 36:07.270
And

503
36:07.770 --> 36:08.854
this too.

504
36:08.938 --> 36:11.232
-Huh? What are you doing? -It's a first for me.

505
36:11.816 --> 36:13.192
Put me down!

506
36:13.276 --> 36:16.612
You know I have a weak heart, so stay still.

507
36:37.258 --> 36:38.217
Should we

508
36:39.176 --> 36:40.261
hurry home?

509
36:41.679 --> 36:42.805
Yes.

510
36:50.771 --> 36:53.858
Hi, Seol-hee. What's up? You came all the way to see me?

511
36:53.941 --> 36:55.526
I'll have what he's having.

512
36:58.654 --> 37:01.240
I've got a reason to drink,

513
37:01.324 --> 37:03.909
but why is my dear Seol-hee in such a bad mood?

514
37:04.660 --> 37:05.619
Oh.

515
37:06.746 --> 37:08.748
Your cousin and grandma

516
37:09.290 --> 37:10.833
ruined my mood.

517
37:12.960 --> 37:13.961
What?

518
37:15.087 --> 37:18.341
I said it'd be best if you gave up now.

519
37:19.300 --> 37:20.217
But ma'am…

520
37:20.301 --> 37:22.887
I was quite fond of you.

521
37:23.804 --> 37:27.433
I thought it was cute that you pretended to be gentle and kind.

522
37:27.516 --> 37:31.479
I thought you'd make a good daughter-in-law for the TS family.

523
37:33.064 --> 37:35.316
And seeing how you grew your company,

524
37:35.399 --> 37:37.610
I thought you could help Ho-rang.

525
37:39.111 --> 37:41.822
Don't look so upset. It's a compliment.

526
37:42.823 --> 37:45.785
All your compliments are in the past tense.

527
37:45.868 --> 37:47.995
Even if it's all in the past,

528
37:48.079 --> 37:51.540
it's still a huge compliment that I trusted you, isn't it?

529
37:54.085 --> 37:55.211
But

530
37:56.212 --> 38:00.341
Ho-rang proved his worth without your help.

531
38:04.178 --> 38:05.262
Drink up.

532
38:08.682 --> 38:12.395
So does that mean you don't need me anymore?

533
38:12.478 --> 38:15.356
I have no reason to pressure him into marriage anymore, so--

534
38:15.439 --> 38:16.565
If you give me another--

535
38:16.649 --> 38:19.777
You know it's not up to me to give you another chance, right?

536
38:22.863 --> 38:25.282
The tea tastes bitter today.

537
38:25.366 --> 38:27.493
I don't think you should drink it.

538
38:32.748 --> 38:35.918
Relying on an old hag could only get me so far.

539
38:39.880 --> 38:43.008
Do-yoon, you have someone tailing Baek Ho-rang, right?

540
38:43.092 --> 38:44.135
Huh?

541
38:44.927 --> 38:45.928
Yeah.

542
38:46.011 --> 38:49.849
I've always had someone tailing him.

543
38:51.809 --> 38:52.643
Then

544
38:53.144 --> 38:55.855
you must know a thing or two about Na Bo-bae.

545
38:58.023 --> 39:02.903
Interesting to hear you bring up Na Bo-bae.

546
39:13.664 --> 39:15.624
I was taught

547
39:15.708 --> 39:19.378
to do my best to protect myself.

548
39:22.882 --> 39:26.427
Why don't we come up with a Plan B?

549
39:29.388 --> 39:32.099
CARDIOTHORACIC SURGERY JANG KI-WOOK

550
40:01.462 --> 40:03.214
MEDICAL RECORD BAEK HO-RANG

551
40:05.174 --> 40:07.301
So he had surgery,

552
40:07.801 --> 40:09.637
but the cardiac device failed

553
40:09.720 --> 40:12.139
because of a power outage?

554
40:18.521 --> 40:19.855
INPATIENT RECORD NA BO-BAE

555
40:19.939 --> 40:21.106
What's this?

556
40:22.191 --> 40:24.652
"Cardiac arrest due to lightning strike"?

557
40:24.735 --> 40:27.446
Look at you giving your name without a shred of shame.

558
40:34.161 --> 40:35.538
Wait a minute.

559
40:38.290 --> 40:40.084
L

560
40:43.379 --> 40:44.547
Hey, it's me.

561
40:45.047 --> 40:48.217
Have you ever seen Na Bo-bae and Baek Ho-rang holding hands

562
40:48.300 --> 40:49.843
or touching each other at all?

563
40:50.761 --> 40:53.013
Damn. You're useless.

564
40:54.431 --> 40:56.475
I'll see for myself.

565
40:57.935 --> 41:00.938
Wow, look. It must be on sale.

566
41:01.021 --> 41:02.147
-Yeah? -Looks good, huh?

567
41:02.231 --> 41:03.274
Looks pretty unhealthy.

568
41:03.357 --> 41:06.860
Come on. We don't have any snacks at home.

569
41:06.944 --> 41:08.737
Looks like buy one, get one free.

570
41:08.821 --> 41:10.781
-I don't think so. -Let's get this.

571
41:14.410 --> 41:15.411
Wait.

572
41:17.538 --> 41:19.415
Yes, Director.

573
41:19.498 --> 41:22.501
Ms. Na, I read the revised script.

574
41:23.294 --> 41:24.420
It's good.

575
41:24.503 --> 41:25.879
-Really? -Yeah.

576
41:25.963 --> 41:27.881
Wanna hear some more good news?

577
41:27.965 --> 41:30.301
We have a meeting with the female lead.

578
41:31.093 --> 41:32.511
The actress playing Hye-ju?

579
41:32.595 --> 41:36.098
Yeah, Yoo Min-hee accepted the part.

580
41:36.890 --> 41:39.852
Yoo Min-hee? Isn't she a huge star?

581
41:39.935 --> 41:42.146
Of course she is. She's a superstar.

582
41:42.229 --> 41:43.856
She loves the script.

583
41:43.939 --> 41:45.941
-She wants to meet next week. -Really?

584
41:46.859 --> 41:48.736
Yes. Got it!

585
41:48.819 --> 41:49.653
Okay.

586
41:50.195 --> 41:51.363
No way!

587
41:51.447 --> 41:53.157
-This is insane! -What is it?

588
41:53.741 --> 41:55.367
We've got our female lead.

589
41:55.993 --> 41:57.036
Yoo Min-hee.

590
42:00.080 --> 42:02.791
-Who is Yoo Min-hee? -You don't know who she is?

591
42:03.751 --> 42:06.295
Don't you watch TV?

592
42:06.837 --> 42:08.464
-TV? -Yeah.

593
42:08.547 --> 42:12.801
-Come on. How do you not know? -So nothing happens when he touches her.

594
42:14.595 --> 42:16.847
That patient, Na Bo-bae, was a little strange.

595
42:16.930 --> 42:18.724
Lots of static electricity.

596
42:19.391 --> 42:21.644
Mr. Baek's heart had run out of battery,

597
42:22.227 --> 42:24.396
but it recharged when he was near Ms. Na.

598
42:25.481 --> 42:28.108
So she really is a human charger.

599
42:36.992 --> 42:38.619
Someone's over the moon, huh?

600
42:39.119 --> 42:41.622
Yoo Min-hee's going to star in my show.

601
42:42.122 --> 42:43.123
Am I dreaming?

602
42:43.624 --> 42:45.167
Can I pinch your cheek?

603
42:45.250 --> 42:48.295
Why would you pinch me? Shouldn't it be the other way round?

604
42:48.379 --> 42:49.755
I guess it's not a dream.

605
42:50.381 --> 42:53.842
I knew you wouldn't agree to be pinched. You're too protective of yourself.

606
42:54.677 --> 42:55.636
What did you say?

607
42:56.220 --> 43:00.140
Now we just need the male lead. I hope they cast a really handsome actor.

608
43:02.226 --> 43:04.728
Why do you care if the actor's handsome?

609
43:04.812 --> 43:07.272
People watch romance dramas for the handsome male leads.

610
43:07.356 --> 43:09.149
That's the bare minimum.

611
43:11.485 --> 43:14.154
You're not casting Mr. Ji Eun-ho as the male lead, are you?

612
43:14.238 --> 43:17.116
Eun-ho? Isn't that kind of a long shot?

613
43:18.117 --> 43:20.828
I mean, the rumors have been cleared up,

614
43:20.911 --> 43:22.955
but our names were linked and all.

615
43:24.081 --> 43:26.458
I don't want him to get caught up in all that again.

616
43:29.128 --> 43:30.212
Whatever.

617
43:41.849 --> 43:44.852
You're the only one I'm interested in, Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

618
43:45.811 --> 43:48.063
So stop being jealous over nothing.

619
43:58.240 --> 44:00.075
She drives me crazy.

620
44:01.702 --> 44:03.078
Clear your mind

621
44:03.787 --> 44:05.414
of distracting thoughts

622
44:06.582 --> 44:07.750
and worries.

623
44:41.700 --> 44:42.910
Hey, Ji-hye.

624
44:46.413 --> 44:47.498
What did you say?

625
44:58.342 --> 45:00.469
Yong-gi! Ji-hye.

626
45:00.552 --> 45:01.512
Hey.

627
45:02.805 --> 45:05.265
What happened? Was it a hit-and-run?

628
45:05.349 --> 45:07.392
A car hit him in an alley and drove off.

629
45:07.476 --> 45:08.852
How badly are you hurt?

630
45:08.936 --> 45:11.104
Just a broken arm. That's all.

631
45:11.188 --> 45:13.816
I don't even need surgery. I'll be out in two days.

632
45:13.899 --> 45:17.110
But how are you going to train with a broken arm?

633
45:17.194 --> 45:18.362
What about your dojo?

634
45:19.571 --> 45:22.074
I already closed it down.

635
45:22.616 --> 45:24.243
You did? When?

636
45:24.910 --> 45:28.205
He closed it down a while ago.

637
45:28.288 --> 45:31.667
He stuck around because he didn't want you to be alone

638
45:31.750 --> 45:34.169
if you gave up writing and moved back to Daejeon.

639
45:34.253 --> 45:36.588
Bo-bae, you're turning 30 soon.

640
45:36.672 --> 45:40.217
I'm so happy you renewed your contract and have your own studio now.

641
45:40.300 --> 45:43.053
I'm glad I can move back to Daejeon on my own now.

642
45:44.471 --> 45:46.056
Good for you.

643
45:46.557 --> 45:49.643
Eat the bone broth I made and get well soon.

644
45:49.726 --> 45:51.603
Don't make Mom and Dad look after you.

645
45:51.687 --> 45:53.313
If you're gonna nag, go home.

646
45:55.107 --> 45:55.941
Sit down.

647
45:56.024 --> 45:57.234
Okay.

648
45:57.734 --> 45:58.694
Have you eaten?

649
45:58.777 --> 46:00.112
I'm good.

650
46:00.195 --> 46:02.656
-Want something to drink? -No, I'm good.

651
46:07.744 --> 46:10.205
Bo-bae, you're turning 30 soon.

652
46:10.289 --> 46:13.542
I'm so happy you renewed your contract and have your own studio now.

653
46:13.625 --> 46:16.295
I'm glad I can move back to Daejeon on my own now.

654
46:16.795 --> 46:20.799
The show's been scheduled, and the female lead's been cast.

655
46:21.592 --> 46:23.343
I'm not lying.

656
46:26.263 --> 46:27.347
You're here…

657
47:02.549 --> 47:04.468
Where did Na Yong-gi go?

658
47:04.551 --> 47:06.136
-Are you his guardian? -Yes.

659
47:06.219 --> 47:07.679
Mr. Na Yong-gi…

660
47:07.763 --> 47:10.098
He was moved to a VIP room two hours ago.

661
47:11.224 --> 47:12.684
A VIP room?

662
47:14.394 --> 47:16.688
Come on. Just a little longer!

663
47:16.772 --> 47:18.649
Is this even hard?

664
47:19.232 --> 47:21.944
You need to have a strong core, you know?

665
47:22.027 --> 47:22.903
It's been a minute!

666
47:22.986 --> 47:24.696
-Yeah, squeeze your glutes. -Squeeze!

667
47:24.780 --> 47:26.657
What are you guys doing?

668
47:26.740 --> 47:28.116
-Bo-bae. -Hey, Bo-bae.

669
47:28.200 --> 47:29.368
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

670
47:31.995 --> 47:34.706
-Seriously? -We haven't done much, Bo-bae.

671
47:34.790 --> 47:37.668
-Just small talk. -Yeah! What's the big deal?

672
47:38.293 --> 47:39.544
We were just talking.

673
47:42.631 --> 47:44.758
We didn't really talk.

674
47:48.303 --> 47:50.013
You're impossible.

675
47:50.097 --> 47:51.181
Huh?

676
47:52.474 --> 47:55.477
-You were at the café. -Hello, I'm Baek Ho-rang.

677
47:55.560 --> 47:56.395
I see.

678
47:58.438 --> 48:00.440
I heard you upgraded my room.

679
48:01.108 --> 48:02.234
Who exactly are you?

680
48:02.317 --> 48:04.653
Well, Ms. Na Bo-bae and I are--

681
48:04.736 --> 48:06.613
Silence! I do not wish to hear it.

682
48:06.697 --> 48:08.281
Why are you talking like that?

683
48:13.996 --> 48:15.664
You're so handsome.

684
48:16.164 --> 48:17.249
Handsome, my ass.

685
48:18.291 --> 48:22.337
Didn't you say you met Bo-bae at the hospital?

686
48:22.421 --> 48:24.923
Is everything okay with you?

687
48:25.507 --> 48:27.884
Oh, back then…

688
48:28.927 --> 48:31.930
Well, I was there for a checkup.

689
48:32.431 --> 48:33.598
How much do you make?

690
48:33.682 --> 48:35.100
Hey!

691
48:35.183 --> 48:37.561
Why are you asking him that?

692
48:37.644 --> 48:39.021
What's your net worth?

693
48:39.688 --> 48:41.815
Do you work out?

694
48:41.898 --> 48:44.234
Yes, I do yoga.

695
48:46.111 --> 48:47.362
Yoga?

696
48:48.447 --> 48:51.700
I heard yoga is good for cardiovascular health.

697
48:57.622 --> 48:58.623
Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

698
49:08.091 --> 49:10.469
Why would you put up with all that?

699
49:10.552 --> 49:13.388
You're usually good at saying no, like a real douchebag.

700
49:13.472 --> 49:14.806
When was I ever a…

701
49:18.060 --> 49:20.020
When was I ever a douchebag?

702
49:20.103 --> 49:21.521
And you guys.

703
49:22.105 --> 49:25.108
Why would you make someone with heart issues do planks?

704
49:25.192 --> 49:26.818
-Heart? -He has heart issues?

705
49:31.448 --> 49:32.282
I mean,

706
49:32.866 --> 49:34.451
his heart…

707
49:35.410 --> 49:37.746
You know, his heart. His feelings.

708
49:37.829 --> 49:39.915
His heart is under stress.

709
49:39.998 --> 49:41.583
He's been busy with work.

710
49:42.167 --> 49:44.461
-He's under a lot of stress. -I'm so stressed.

711
49:44.544 --> 49:45.921
His heart's under stress.

712
49:46.505 --> 49:49.341
Exactly. You can relieve stress by working out.

713
49:49.424 --> 49:53.386
But why would you two help him relieve his stress?

714
49:55.388 --> 49:56.640
Let me see.

715
49:56.723 --> 49:57.849
-Bo-bae! -No!

716
50:04.940 --> 50:07.692
My electricity doesn't affect him.

717
50:07.776 --> 50:08.777
What?

718
50:09.903 --> 50:11.613
What? It doesn't affect him?

719
50:13.115 --> 50:14.950
This punk knows about your powers?

720
50:15.742 --> 50:17.369
Yeah, he knows.

721
50:18.036 --> 50:20.872
I can touch his bare skin like this, and nothing happens.

722
50:22.082 --> 50:23.166
-Yes. -Yeah.

723
50:24.501 --> 50:26.211
-But… -I'm fine.

724
50:26.294 --> 50:27.504
-But how… -That's…

725
50:27.587 --> 50:29.464
Come on. Let me see.

726
50:29.548 --> 50:31.299
Did you overdo it? Are you okay?

727
50:32.634 --> 50:33.468
I'm fine.

728
50:33.552 --> 50:37.013
Yoga's actually harder than planks.

729
50:37.514 --> 50:38.682
What's going on?

730
50:38.765 --> 50:40.350
-The electricity… -I'm fine.

731
50:40.433 --> 50:41.810
Why are you fine?

732
50:48.233 --> 50:51.153
How did you know my brother was in the hospital?

733
50:53.530 --> 50:56.491
Why didn't you tell me?

734
50:57.993 --> 50:58.910
I just…

735
50:59.536 --> 51:01.204
It's a family matter.

736
51:01.705 --> 51:05.876
You were already busy, so I didn't want to bother you.

737
51:08.503 --> 51:10.964
Wow, I'm so hurt.

738
51:11.047 --> 51:12.132
What?

739
51:12.215 --> 51:13.717
It really hurts…

740
51:16.261 --> 51:18.430
that my heart's aching.

741
51:18.513 --> 51:20.849
I mean, it's not really that…

742
51:22.184 --> 51:23.310
Is it because of the planks?

743
51:25.228 --> 51:29.691
My heart starts to ache when I'm worried or anxious.

744
51:30.400 --> 51:34.112
I start imagining all kinds of things that could go wrong.

745
51:34.863 --> 51:35.906
Right now,

746
51:36.489 --> 51:40.994
it hurts so much that you didn't rely on me.

747
51:42.954 --> 51:45.332
It makes me wonder if you don't trust me.

748
51:45.916 --> 51:48.501
It's not that I don't trust you.

749
51:49.586 --> 51:50.420
I just…

750
51:51.546 --> 51:53.632
It's because I like you so much.

751
51:54.716 --> 51:58.762
I didn't want to make you worry or burden you with my problems.

752
51:59.679 --> 52:02.766
You already have enough to worry about.

753
52:09.272 --> 52:11.316
What are you doing all of a sudden?

754
52:15.070 --> 52:15.904
Are you crazy?

755
52:15.987 --> 52:19.157
I think I finally understand why you called me cute.

756
52:19.991 --> 52:22.035
You're really cute.

757
52:22.118 --> 52:23.703
Seriously…

758
52:28.541 --> 52:31.920
So you didn't want me to worry because you like me?

759
52:32.462 --> 52:35.423
You said you felt hurt because I didn't rely on you.

760
52:35.507 --> 52:37.092
I think that's adorable too.

761
52:41.596 --> 52:45.976
Let me be a part of your life from now on.

762
52:48.061 --> 52:51.022
When someone in your family is sick, let me know.

763
52:51.106 --> 52:54.693
And if something goes wrong, we'll get through it together.

764
52:58.780 --> 53:00.573
Let's do it together. You and me.

765
53:01.449 --> 53:03.034
Together?

766
53:03.118 --> 53:05.537
Yeah. Together.

767
53:18.258 --> 53:19.259
Well…

768
53:20.385 --> 53:21.845
Anyway,

769
53:22.512 --> 53:25.307
TS's 30th anniversary party

770
53:25.932 --> 53:27.475
is coming up.

771
53:28.268 --> 53:29.227
Would you…

772
53:32.605 --> 53:35.483
like to go with me?

773
53:39.154 --> 53:41.239
Is this what you were building up to?

774
53:42.490 --> 53:44.367
Sure. I'll go with you.

775
53:45.201 --> 53:46.161
We'll go together.

776
53:48.288 --> 53:49.331
Together?

777
53:50.623 --> 53:51.791
Together.

778
54:12.020 --> 54:13.396
-Welcome. -Welcome.

779
54:13.480 --> 54:15.148
This way, please.

780
54:32.374 --> 54:35.710
Sorry, I don't really like people touching my bare skin.

781
54:37.045 --> 54:39.672
We can't do your makeup without--

782
54:39.756 --> 54:41.132
-Ma'am. -Yes?

783
54:43.343 --> 54:45.470
-Please take good care of her. -Of course.

784
54:49.516 --> 54:50.517
Thank you.

785
55:35.353 --> 55:36.396
Let's go.

786
55:38.690 --> 55:40.358
You don't seem impressed.

787
55:40.442 --> 55:41.276
It's Mr. Baek

788
55:42.110 --> 55:43.445
you want to impress.

789
55:45.447 --> 55:47.740
Why isn't Mr. Baek coming with us?

790
55:47.824 --> 55:50.577
He's already there, waiting for you.

791
55:52.954 --> 55:53.997
Thank you.

792
55:54.914 --> 55:55.874
Let's go.

793
56:13.641 --> 56:16.811
It seems like it's just about confirmed.

794
56:17.312 --> 56:19.397
With Assemblyman Choi Tae-sik arrested…

795
56:19.481 --> 56:20.773
That's right.

796
56:20.857 --> 56:23.693
Maybe that's why you're positively glowing today, Mr. Baek.

797
56:23.776 --> 56:26.488
You should be the face of the brand instead of Ji Eun-ho.

798
56:26.571 --> 56:29.574
-Well, aren't you a smooth talker? -That's right.

799
56:40.919 --> 56:41.836
Thank you.

800
56:43.880 --> 56:45.548
Is everything all right?

801
56:45.632 --> 56:46.508
Yes.

802
56:46.591 --> 56:47.425
Oh.

803
56:49.135 --> 56:50.678
Can I drink this water?

804
56:50.762 --> 56:53.306
Yes. We'll be on our way now.

805
56:53.389 --> 56:54.224
Okay.

806
57:16.371 --> 57:19.040
PORTABLE CHARGER

807
57:29.259 --> 57:31.511
MR. YOON

808
57:45.024 --> 57:46.442
What are you doing here?

809
57:48.611 --> 57:49.445
Oh, hello.

810
57:49.529 --> 57:52.407
You said you had a date. Why are you here alone?

811
57:53.032 --> 57:54.534
She's on her way.

812
57:55.034 --> 57:57.495
Then let's chat until she gets here.

813
57:59.122 --> 58:00.665
The marriage isn't happening,

814
58:00.748 --> 58:03.793
but we still need to show everyone TS and Hanlim are on good terms.

815
58:05.211 --> 58:07.463
The event will begin shortly.

816
58:07.547 --> 58:09.882
Please take your seats.

817
01:00:09.627 --> 01:00:11.838
Call an ambulance.

818
01:00:12.797 --> 01:00:15.550
No photos. No photos, please!

819
01:02:04.325 --> 01:02:08.955
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
